      "writtenOn": "2019-07-09T14:29:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think not. For the moment, you can only create application credentials for projects, so project members should be able to see their application credentials, and I think system readers should be able to see users\u0027 access rules but I can\u0027t really think of a reason domain readers should need to. I\u0027m open to discuss it though.",
